      "Builds a RunComfy CLI workflow for extending a source video URL.",
      "Drafts continuation prompts that focus on the next action beat.",
      "Explains how to chain several short extensions into a longer sequence.",
      "Documents expected CLI exit codes and basic troubleshooting paths."
    ],
